      <t:profileDesc xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
         <t:abstract>
            <t:p>This is a general record for any possible constellation of the Miracles of Takla Hāymānot.</t:p>
            <t:p>The full version as witnessed e.g. by <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/IVorlov35">Saint Petersburg, Institut Vostočnyh Rukopisej Rossijskoj Akademii Nauk, IV Orlov 35</t:ref> contains up to 72 miracles divided into three cycles of 22 miracles and a homily each,  <t:ref target="#Birth">the Cycle for the Birth on <t:date>22 Tahsas</t:date></t:ref>,  <t:ref target="#Concept">the Cycle for Conception on <t:date>24  Maggābit</t:date></t:ref>, <t:ref target="#Trans">the Cycle for the Translation of his relics on <t:date>12 Gǝnbot</t:date></t:ref>, in addition to <t:ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT5778MirTaklaHaymanotSabal">Miracles of Takla Hāymānot worked in Šabal</t:ref>. Other witnesses may include any subset, e.g. <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BLorient723">London, British Library, BL Oriental 723</t:ref> with 44 + 2 miracles, <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet110">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 110</t:ref>, with 34 miracles, <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ANLcr16 "><seg corresp="ANLcr16 ">No item: ANLcr16</seg></t:ref> with 21 miracles, <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BLorient721">London, British Library, BL Oriental 721</t:ref> and <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BLorient722">London, British Library, BL Oriental 722</t:ref>, <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BLorient724">London, British Library, BL Oriental 724</t:ref> with 16 miracles each, <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BLorient727">London, British Library, BL Oriental 727</t:ref> with 18 miracles, <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BLorient728">London, British Library, BL Oriental 728</t:ref> with 20 miracles, etc. </t:p>
         </t:abstract>
